Subject: [PATCH 035/159] ASoC: codec duplicated callback function goes to component on sgtl5000
Date: Mon, 8 Aug 2016 08:58:28 +0000
Message-ID: <87invb7ig2.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
References: <87wpjr8xld.wl%kuninori.morimoto.gx@renesas.com>
